class_name GalaxyKeenActions
extends RefCounted
## Keen's actions in a level, the same in the Galaxy episodes apart from the
## sprites: the numbers are Omnispeak's (`data/keen4/ACTION.CK4`, Keen 4
## v1.4, marked (Omni)); the think, contact and react functions are
## [GalaxyKeen]'s methods. The sprite names are resolved by the episode's
## sprite list (Keen 4: [Keen4Sprites]). One row per action, as
## [method GalaxyAction.table_from] reads it:
## name, left, right, type, flags, timer, velocity x, y, think, contact,
## react, next.

